type: article
title: "Ideological Signatures: A Grid-Relative Criterion for the Individuation of Ideologies"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bourguet González"
    given-names: "Luis Felipe"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4673-4486"
    affiliation: "LabOnt – Center for Ontology, University of Turin; Complex Systems Science Laboratory, Hiroshima University"
date-released: 2026-10-15
